                <head>Arbitration convention between the United States and Spain</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, April 20, 1908.
                        Ratification advised by the Senate, April 22, 1908. Ratified by the
                        President, May 28, 1908. Ratified by Spain, May 11, 1908. Ratifications
                        exchanged at Washington, June 2, 1908. Proclaimed, June 3, 1908.</hi></p>

